@pmndrs/denoiser-gi1
====================

The WGSL kernels in this package (src/wgsl.ts) and their CPU reference
(src/reference.ts) are ports of the GI-1 denoiser in AMD Capsaicin v1.3
(https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/Capsaicin, commit 914b915:
src/core/src/render_techniques/gi1/gi1.comp, ReprojectGI and FilterGI, and
src/core/src/render_techniques/gi1/gi_denoiser.hlsl), distributed under the
